        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocrasher（大石头杀人事件）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH and SMASH!!!</strong> Savor the ultimate thrill of crushing everything in your way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushing the little figures along the road will increase the boulder's size and weight, granting it greater acceleration and diving force! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Levels to Choose From</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each stage offers a unique style — from the surface to the underground, roll your way through and crush everything in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics and Collision Feedback</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience dynamic physics-based destruction. The way objects shatter depends on what you hit and how fast you crash into it, giving each impact a different level of feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Interactive Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Want to clear the road for your giant boulder? Try out different abilities at your disposal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Tap the boulder to push it in any direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Tap obstacles to smash them apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Crush as many little critters as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charming Cartoon Art Style &amp; Immersive Audio-Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cute and quirky giant boulder, swaying grass and flowers, bouncing roaches — all enhanced by post-processing filters, outlines, sound effects, and screen shake. Together they create an engaging and stress-relieving audiovisual experience.</p>",
